{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"action-nav","type":"text","text":"# 动作曲线｜原Montage XYZ与明确Profile模式\n原Task／Main→End来源 → CMC同一RMS／native时间 → 胶囊物理；作者点授权、混出、Task完成与贡献消费分别认证。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|契约与证据]] · [[Movement/结构]] · [[Movement/GGYGO_流程_移动与位移.canvas|主流程]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1800,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"action-scope","type":"text","text":"## 实际验证与剩余边界\n完成须同一Activation／StepToken／Task／Handle／Source；OwnerSync输入Scope不是动作ID。\nactive Montage=None、BlendOut或Release成功不代表胶囊最后贡献已消费。\nNotifyNatural在消费完成前核原live实例；瞬时移除实例的其他混出配置须明确兼容。\nPose只修身体余量；胶囊执行与鞋底几何分别验收，碰撞不走追补链。\n[[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移#15. 当前实现：复杂度收口与职责拆分|本轮有限门禁／历史失败／未验范围]]","x":490,"y":1050,"width":1410,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"action-author","type":"text","text":"## 原资产与离线业务生产\nPyrios原Sequence含累计RootMotion_PosX/Y/Z；Animation依原Montage／FullBody建立完整Main→End绑定。\nMontage作者单点Name=Event.Montage.CancelPoint；完整End与末帧混出／独立时长归资产，原Sequence保留。\nKevin离线业务生产保持独立模式；原曲线唯一来源，缺失明确拒绝。","x":-205,"y":240,"width":410,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"action-profile","type":"text","text":"## 原SourceBinding／业务Profile\n当前普攻：原Montage／Slot／有序Sections／Segments；Task给原实例／位置／固定速率。\nMapMontageInterval同次完整验证，Movement核执行曲线一次；逐源／loop差分PosXYZ；私有native末端量化认证完整源末帧，raw身份不变。\nnative动画RootMotion互斥；业务Profile另配CV／Duration／Scale，地面XY，无错误替代。","x":695,"y":240,"width":410,"height":350,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"action-ga","type":"text","text":"## GA／原Task编排\nGA持原Activation／StepToken／Task／Handle，Main→End同一轨迹。\n原Task Point事实 → HandleMontageNotify → EnableStepInterruption；新播放关门。\n过点QueryQualifiedMovementIntent／SubscribeQualifiedMovementIntent原Scope；Held／新Press须合格，原Handle不换。\n移动精确取消后结束GA／重置；新攻击由GA接续，Section不授门。\n自然等TaskCompleted＋MotionCompleted；必需Pose失效中止。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[Animation/结构]]","x":-205,"y":630,"width":410,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"action-begin","type":"text","text":"## CMC::BeginMontageActionMotion\n原Source／Instance／当前Section位置／Rate／Scale → 核身份／范围／互斥／有限值 → 原Handle或失败。\nauthority或原本地autonomous，Walking／NavWalking／Falling。\n捕获Actor基准与MeshScale×业务Scale一次，退自身Stop／TurnBack，挂同一Action RMS。\nMain→End不换资源；End校正读取当前原位置。动作槽归CMC私有ActionMotionExecution，无第二时钟；Profile明确路径见下方。","x":620,"y":630,"width":410,"height":390,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"action-sample","type":"text","text":"## native RMS PrepareRootMotion\n实际sim／tick＋同一native时间映射Main→End的原Sequence分片，累计PosXYZ逐源／loop差分。\n固定Actor基准×捕获Scale → WorldDelta／tick → Override XYZ。\n零位移持有；最后区间标bPreparedNaturalEnd，不在Prepare宣告消费完成。\nnative Walking／NavWalking／Falling继续胶囊碰撞／重力／落地。","x":1360,"y":660,"width":410,"height":360,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"action-clean","type":"text","text":"## 打断／失败／精确释放\nGA作者点后QueryQualifiedMovementIntent／原Scope订阅；合格Held／新Press → CancelMontageActionMotionForMovement → 原输入WalkRun。\nGA结束／重置连段，新播放关门；CMC不持攻击门／段政策。\n自然：TaskCompleted＋MotionCompleted → RequestAbilityEnd。\nCompleted有界收据；其他理由中和原贡献、撤原回调。\nGA先脱资源再退原Observer／Handle／Task／Trace，保空气Z／后继。","x":2080,"y":630,"width":410,"height":390,"color":"1"},
    {
      "id": "action-native-task-facts",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Task：混出与播放完成\n原非Interrupted OnBlendOut → NotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut(原Handle,InstanceId)。\nCMC核配置末段auto-blend窗口；原native尾区间继续，不通知MotionCompleted。\n原OnCompleted → ReleaseMontageActionMotion(原Handle,Completed)，仅接受有界Drain。\nGA记TaskCompleted，等待原MotionCompleted；原Interrupted／Cancelled精确中止。\n混出触发与时长读Montage配置，无额外播放时钟。",
      "x": -205,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-native-consumed-final",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CMC：最后贡献消费完成\nApplyRootMotionToVelocity → Super原生应用Prepared贡献；标bPreparedContributionConsumed。\nnative胶囊物理／碰撞完成 → UpdateCharacterStateAfterMovement。\nPublishMontageActionMotionCompletion核原资源、natural-end／consumed且非cancel；不在历史回放发布。\n先脱原接收者，再回传精确原Handle；GA Observe回调记MotionCompleted。\n原TaskCompleted是另一事实；自然完成不借后继或补执行器。",
      "x": 2760,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "1"
    },
		{"id":"profile-original-begin","type":"text","text":"## 明确Profile：原GA申请并观察\nBoss BeginOriginalMeleeMotion携保存Original／CMC／Profile／rate→CMC BeginActionMotion。\n核authority／地面／互斥及必需配置，返回原Handle或INDEX_NONE＋定位诊断。\nGA保存原CMC／Handle后ObserveActionMotionFailure；唯一原槽持强Profile／弱原角色Mesh。\n注册拒绝精确清原资源并失败原动作，外调后重验原身份。\n[[BossAI/结构|原消费者]]","x":620,"y":1580,"width":550,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"profile-native-prepare","type":"text","text":"## Profile RMS：原native实际区间\n原资源随Clone保留，回放不调用当前观察者；native时间唯一。\nPrepareRootMotion核原Profile／曲线／rate／duration／CMC／Mesh和finite sim／tick。\n差分累计轨迹×捕获Scale→固定入口Mesh旋转→WorldXY／tick。\n失效明确诊断；合法零／partial末帧保持。\n同一ActionMotionExecution仅资源与观察者，不推进时钟。","x":1360,"y":1580,"width":550,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"profile-original-failure","type":"text","text":"## Profile失效：先退原资源→原GA\n坏配置／模式／区间／非有限位移→原source Additive／Identity／MarkedForRemoval，不伪装Finished。\nFailProfileActionMotion精确中和原source→EndActionMotion清原slot／observer→至多一次原Handle／Error回调。\nBoss核保存原CMC／Handle／Original→FailOriginalAction→RequestAbilityEnd(Original,true,true)。\n不重捕当前激活／借HasActive；重复Prepare／End不重发，不清后继。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行#显式业务 Profile 兼容模式|失败合同]]","x":2080,"y":1580,"width":550,"height":430,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"profile-normal-tail","type":"text","text":"## Profile正常零区间／末帧／退出\n零位移／零sim继续合法；partial最后区间原native贡献保持。\n自然到期、正常离地或原GA EndActionMotion精确退自己，不中和正常Prepared末帧。\nProfile没有Montage完成观察语义；两明确模式不互相兜底。\nGA精确清原Handle，RMS／CMC保持原生生命周期。","x":1360,"y":2180,"width":550,"height":300,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"action-e1","fromNode":"action-author","fromSide":"right","toNode":"action-profile","toSide":"left","label":"原动画来源或明确业务Profile生产"},
